      "y": 0,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "# Parent Workspace Canvas\n\nReplace this title with the name of your workspace.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Navigation\n\n- Double-click a file node to open it.\n- The embedded child canvas opens as its own tab.\n- Edit the child canvas file to change the sub-workspace.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "## Embedded child canvas (Canvas-in-Canvas)",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60005",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
