      "y": 180,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "## Linked notes",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60007",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "file": "Notes/workspace-notes.md",
      "subpath": "#Overview",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f60008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "## Replace these paths\n\n- Child canvas: `Child/child-canvas.canvas`\n- Note: `Notes/workspace-notes.md`\n\nCanvas JSON has no comments, so guidance lives in node labels. To nest one level deeper, duplicate the child canvas file and point this node at the copy.\n\nLayering idiom: this parent canvas holds navigation and overview nodes; the embedded child canvas node is the prominent work area.",
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
